<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>UT Table Tennis Team - 德州大学乒乓球队</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --ut-orange: #BF5700;
            --ut-dark: #333f48;
            --white: #ffffff;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: var(--ut-dark);
        }

        header {
            background-color: var(--ut-orange);
            color: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .team-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        /* 队员卡片样式 */
        .member-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .member-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
        }

        .member-photo {
            width: 100%;
            height: 250px;
            background-color: #ddd;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .member-info {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .member-name {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
            color: var(--ut-orange);
        }

        .member-role {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
            background-color: var(--ut-orange);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>🏓 UT Table Tennis Team</h1>
    <p>Hook 'em Horns! 追求卓越，乒出精彩</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
    <div class="team-grid">
        
        <div class="member-card">
            <div class="member-photo" style="background-image: url('https://via.placeholder.com/300x250'); background-size: cover;"></div>
            <div class="member-info">
                <div class="member-name">张三 (Longhorn Zhang)</div>
                <div class="member-role">队长 / 右手横板快攻</div>
                <p>三届校内赛冠军，擅长暴力弧圈球。</p>
                <a href="profile-zhang.html" class="btn">查看个人主页</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="member-card">
            <div class="member-photo" style="background-image: url('https://via.placeholder.com/300x250'); background-size: cover;"></div>
            <div class="member-info">
                <div class="member-name">李四 (Emma Li)</div>
                <div class="member-role">副队长 / 左手直板长胶</div>
                <p>防守稳如泰山，校队头号“发球机”。</p>
                <a href="profile-li.html" class="btn">查看个人主页</a>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
